(A particle or concurrent force system is in static equilibrium if the resultant force) Tj
T*
(vanishes identically:) Tj
T*
(* Equations of Equilibrium: Sigma Fx = 0, and Sigma Fy = 0.) Tj
T*
(* Free Body Diagram \(FBD\): An isolated sketch of the physical body stripped of its) Tj
T*
(surroundings, showing all applied active loads, gravitational weights, and reactive) Tj
T*
(contact forces/cable tensions.) Tj
T*
(* Lami's Theorem: If three coplanar concurrent forces acting at a point are in static) Tj
T*
(equilibrium, each force is directly proportional to the sine of the angle between the) Tj
T*
(remaining two forces.) Tj
T*
(Formula: P / sin\(alpha\) = Q / sin\(beta\) = R / sin\(gamma\), where alpha is angle between Q) Tj
T*
(and R, beta between P and R, gamma between P and Q.) Tj
