(pin support at A and a roller support at B. It carries a uniformly distributed load) Tj
T*
(\(UDL\) of w = 15 kN/m over the left 4.0 m span \(from x = 0 to x = 4 m\), and a) Tj
T*
(concentrated point load of P = 50 kN at x = 6.0 m. Calculate the support reactions at A) Tj
T*
(and B.) Tj
